## Environment
- **OS:** Windows 11 Pro (x64)
- **Node:** v22.17.1
- **gitnexus:** 1.6.5 (global install)
- **@ladybugdb/core:** 0.16.1 (resolved at `gitnexus/node_modules/@ladybugdb/core`, win32-x64 native binding present)
